"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">青春</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孫翊倫</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">阮ê約束</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雲&nbsp; &nbsp; 谷</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_99.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>干樂</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">姚雅芳</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_37.html\" target=\"_blank\">生理買賣</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">3</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂美親&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_28.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>『我爸爸也會講你們這種話』</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">5</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃桂蘭</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_73.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>霧城</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">37</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳俐雯</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_32.html\" target=\"_blank\">落花夢醒</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">40</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_85.html\" target=\"_blank\">允頭路</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／張永昌</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／吳玉祥<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_64.html\" target=\"_blank\">湠開台語文影視內容：</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_64.html\" target=\"_blank\">電影．戲劇．動畫．漫畫．流行音樂</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">轉型正義kap不當黨產台語講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／周婉窈</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／張翠硯<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tui-kmtroc-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tuì KMT/ROC黨國統治到民主化</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tui-kmtroc-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">——台灣轉型正義kap歷史記憶</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡秋芬<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">新ê舊日誌——記念『米拉』（二）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳高登<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/be-tiau.html\" target=\"_blank\">花bē tiâu枝</a><br />16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳錦月<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/pun.html\" target=\"_blank\">Pun奶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">方鶴翔<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">牽手</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>19</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lîm Iúⁿ-chû<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/lim-iu-chu-oohne-ne-oohka-tsiannkathika.html\" target=\"_blank\">小弟來--looh</a>&nbsp;<br />21</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">光景bóng uē</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Táng Huī-bûn<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">埔里做三獻</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏月華<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">來去澎湖</a><br />24</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張雅雯<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/blog-post_46.html\" target=\"_blank\">埃及</a><br />28</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林淑娟<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2023/12/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">茶ê滋味</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿媽ê話<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_19.html\" target=\"_blank\">上悲傷ê落雨天</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>31</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林子捷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_97.html\" target=\"_blank\">學台文ê體會</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>33</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Aminegy Khó͘<span style=\"white-space: pre;\">\t</span><br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ti-tek-kau-te.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tí-te̍k Kàu-té</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/ti-tek-kau-te.html\" target=\"_blank\">抵敵到底</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\">35</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large; white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Chio̍h An-ná<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/e_89.html\" target=\"_blank\">自由刺激ê囡仔樂園</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">李淑貞<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/12/tibehe.html\" target=\"_blank\">行！Tī日頭beh落山ê時（三）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>41</span></div></div><div><br /></div><br /></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgDW-rrQFVNI7ghDxlwBnJTJLuK_XeJG_L33ru6Uye9HCqJbi0VpooXtWKWkiu6yqUunhabYOqAlW4DzPexDvF4rjfChH2tp50c4pZOrHu7FjLPhGoGx-tSSPmEzRm_662t3ZSAWTT7OHGzgPBO7Kl31fsMLrnxyJFjl-2NMaVLvALL_h4xNTrcZjNH93pA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%81.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgDW-rrQFVNI7ghDxlwBnJTJLuK_XeJG_L33ru6Uye9HCqJbi0VpooXtWKWkiu6yqUunhabYOqAlW4DzPexDvF4rjfChH2tp50c4pZOrHu7FjLPhGoGx-tSSPmEzRm_662t3ZSAWTT7OHGzgPBO7Kl31fsMLrnxyJFjl-2NMaVLvALL_h4xNTrcZjNH93pA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%81.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjtEmdendEHbjCaxJVYnAtoNn2rlFDz0wrMXwoIUd4gFVRstp1nV9co0l62EUa-5QQ3f04q2VRx5-a8BC9mCwIZp2WiQdOya5wn8HEQmRWhmaKoevGwEuZZ3VlfP6qmC9G-ulMZKxH2N_G7QdUml2HdWfoK5L4r1UUPRt8ijdRXNtWTXlOFOqXrVwHL37IF/s1424/356%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E8%A3%A1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjtEmdendEHbjCaxJVYnAtoNn2rlFDz0wrMXwoIUd4gFVRstp1nV9co0